'''Summon Greater Harbinger of the Arcane''' is a [[skill]] granted by {{il|The Surging Thoughts}}.

==Skill functions and interactions==
The summoned Harbinger is immortal, and occasionally casts [[Arcane Surge]] on the player. Arcane Surge is a [[buff]] that lasts 4 seconds, with a cooldown of 8 seconds, and grants the following benefits:
* 20% increased Cast Speed
* 30% increased Mana Regeneration Rate

It also simultaneously grants a buff called "The Surging Thoughts" that grants the following benefits for 4 seconds, also with a cooldown of 8 seconds:

* 15% chance to Shock
* Damage Penetrates 10% Lightning Resistance

All "Summon Harbinger" skills share a maximum of 1 Summoned Harbinger.

